            "heading": "RE[SENS]– THE FIRST HIGH-TECH SUSTAINABLE BRAND SPECIALIZING IN SENSITIVE SKINCARE."
          }
        },
        "richtext_BX4zqX": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>All brand products are based on advanced research developed by Ukrainian scientists using the finest ingredients from around the world – from Europe to Japan, Korea, and the USA.<br/></p><p>Our goal is not just to \"soothe\" the skin but to restore its natural ability for self-healing and health maintenance by providing it with the necessary components to strengthen and balance.<br/></p><p>We love ourselves sensitive because sensitivity is not a weakness but a profound ability to feel and care for oneself. In a world where pollution, stress, and the fast pace of life have become part of our reality, sensitive skin requires special care. And that is exactly what we offer.</p>",
            "text_size": 16
          }
        }
      },
