        "text": "<p>For sensitive skin, the most important thing is not overloading or \"aggressive\" methods, but balance and harmony. That is why the brand’s formulas feature a unique holistic approach that combines immuno-, neuro-, and sensi-cosmetology to support the skin and provide care without compromising its natural barrier functions.</p>",
