        "text": "<p>•\tGreat Panda (Ailuropoda melanoleuca)<br/>•\tTiger (Panthera tigris)<br/>•\tAmazonian dolphin (Inia geoffrensis)<br/>•\tGorilla (Gorilla beringei, Gorilla gorilla)<br/>•\tElephant (Loxodonta spp., Elephas maximus)<br/>•\tGiraffe (Giraffa camelopardalis)<br/>•\tLeopard (Panthera pardus)<br/>•\tOrangutan (Pongo spp.)<br/>•\tSea turtle (Cheloniidae, Dermochelyidae)<br/>•\tRhizophora spp.<br/>•\tCalifornia redwood (Sequoia sempervirens)<br/>•\tThorny archives (Pachypodium spp.)<br/>•\tLarge elephant grass (Adansonia digitata)<br/>•\tDwarf Oak (Quercus spp.)<br/></p>",
